@startuml state machine diagram

title Autonomous & Manual Operation State Machine

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultTextAlignment left
skinparam shadowing false
scale max 4000*2500

skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #F8F9FA
  BorderColor #444444
  FontSize 12
  ArrowColor #212121
  ArrowFontSize 11
  StartColor #2E7D32
  EndColor #C62828
}

[*] --> Standby : Control System Power ON

Standby --> Ready : Communication & Localization Established
Ready --> Moving : Autonomous Move Command (NavigationCommand::Move)
Moving --> Fail : Localization/Comm Error, Danger Zone Violation, Timeout
Moving --> Goal : Target Arrived (Residual Error <= 3 cm)
Moving --> Ready : Move Canceled (NavigationCommand::Standby)
Goal --> Ready : Robot Deviated from Goal Tolerance Area
Ready --> Tracking : Moving Bucket Tracking Active (TargetId::MovingBucket & Move)
Tracking --> Fail : Target Lost / Out of Trackable Range
Tracking --> Ready : Tracking Command Released (NavigationCommand::Standby)
Ready --> Fail : Autonomous Move Disabled
Fail --> Ready : Error Cleared & Localization Restored

Standby : <b>Mode: Manual Teleoperation</b>\n• Drive (Translation & Rotation): Manual\n• Launcher Trigger: Manual\n• Launcher Velocity: Manual\n• Gripper Mechanism: Enabled (Manual)

Ready : <b>Mode: Standby / Armed (Localization OK)</b>\n• Drive (Translation & Rotation): Manual\n• Launcher Trigger: Manual\n• Launcher Velocity: Manual\n• Gripper Mechanism: Disabled

Moving : <b>Mode: Autonomous Navigation Active</b>\n• Drive (Translation & Rotation): Autonomous (Pure Pursuit + P-Control)\n• Launcher Trigger: Manual\n• Launcher Velocity: Autonomous (Target Distance FB)\n• Gripper Mechanism: Disabled

Goal : <b>Mode: Goal Position Reached (< 3cm Tolerance)</b>\n• Drive (Translation & Rotation): Manual / Hold\n• Launcher Trigger: Manual\n• Launcher Velocity: Manual\n• Gripper Mechanism: Disabled

Tracking : <b>Mode: Moving Bucket Tracking Active</b>\n• Drive Translation: Manual\n• Drive Rotation: Autonomous (Facing Target Bucket)\n• Launcher Trigger: Manual\n• Launcher Velocity: Autonomous (Target Distance FB)\n• Gripper Mechanism: Disabled

Fail : <b>Mode: Safety Fallback</b>\n• Autonomous Execution: Disabled\n• Drive & Actuators: Manual Teleoperation Fallback Only

@enduml
